<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Crop Circle Atlas</name>
    <description>Formation sites, candidate fields, and rough locality references are separated. Locality references are hidden by default and are not crop-circle locations, ray origins, or alignment targets. Projection lines remain exploratory and have no demonstrated predictive validity. Locality references use GeoNames under CC BY 4.0: https://www.geonames.org/</description>
    <Style id="site">
      <IconStyle>
        <color>ffc5d14f</color>
        <scale>0.9</scale>
      </IconStyle>
      <LabelStyle>
        <scale>0</scale>
      </LabelStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="candidate">
      <IconStyle>
        <color>ff55adf6</color>
        <scale>0.8</scale>
      </IconStyle>
      <LabelStyle>
        <scale>0</scale>
      </LabelStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="locality">
      <IconStyle>
        <color>ff999999</color>
        <scale>0.48</scale>
      </IconStyle>
      <LabelStyle>
        <scale>0</scale>
      </LabelStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="ray">
      <LineStyle>
        <color>ff4fd1c5</color>
        <width>2</width>
      </LineStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="provisional-ray">
      <LineStyle>
        <color>ff55adf6</color>
        <width>2</width>
      </LineStyle>
    </Style>
    <Folder>
      <name>Corroborated and registered formation sites</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>1994-06-14 - Aloha [Sunset Hwy.]</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Aloha [Sunset Hwy.]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Oregon, United States&lt;br&gt;Date: 1994-06-14 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: registered_site&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: source_report_degrees_minutes; uncertainty 1.5 km&lt;br&gt;The report's coarse degree-minute coordinate is used as a source-reported site with 1.5 km uncertainty so its reviewed cardinal axes do not originate from a locality centroid. It is not independently field-verified and is not eligible as an alignment target.&lt;br&gt;Sources: ICCRA; Crop Circle Center PDF catalog&lt;br&gt;https://iccra.org/bystate/Oregon/ICCRA%20-%20OR%20-%20Aloha,%20Sunset%20Hwy,%20Washington%20County%20(June%2014,%201994).html; https://www.cropcirclecenter.com/</description>
