      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>1997-06-28 - Wavra Farm, Salem / Silver Creek Falls</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Wavra Farm, Salem / Silver Creek Falls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Oregon, United States&lt;br&gt;Date: 1997-06-28 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: corroborated_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: user_supplied_google_earth_kmz_landmark_registration; uncertainty 0.02 km&lt;br&gt;The supplied Google Earth Pro GroundOverlay replaces the rejected Jordan Street placement, whose anchor was 1,428 metres away. The exact KML LatLonBox and rotation are retained; the formation anchor is mapped from source pixel 181,126. The 2000-07-23 historical frame corroborates the divided highway, curved drives, tree rows, buildings, and field edges. The registration remains excluded from formal alignment calculations pending independent checkpoints.&lt;br&gt;Sources: ICCRA&lt;br&gt;https://iccra.org/bystate/Oregon/ICCRA%20-%20OR%20-%20Wavr%20Farm,%20Salem-Silver%20Creek%20Falls,%20Marion%20County%20(June%2028,%201997).html</description>
        <ExtendedData>
