          </Data>
          <Data name="straight_component_status">
            <value>not_analyzed</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="orientation_status">
            <value>not_reviewed</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-122.8962105,44.8737785,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>1998-07-23 - Whiskey Hill / Hubbard</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Whiskey Hill / Hubbard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Oregon, United States&lt;br&gt;Date: 1998-07-23 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: corroborated_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: user_supplied_source_photo_registration; uncertainty 0.035 km&lt;br&gt;Coordinates digitized from the user-supplied screenshot/status bar; uncertainty is conservative. The supplied source-photo registration and same-field context corroborate the field, but the 1998 formation is not directly visible in the referenced 2000 historical frame. Evidence hashes identify the user-supplied registration screenshot and the source photograph; they are not hashes of the report URL.&lt;br&gt;Sources: ICCRA; Crop Circle Center PDF catalog&lt;br&gt;https://iccra.org/bystate/Oregon/ICCRA%20-%20OR%20-%20Whiskey%20Hill-Hubbard,%20Clackamas%20County%20(July%2023,%201998).html; https://www.cropcirclecenter.com/</description>
