        <name>2000-08-05 - Hubbard / Woodburn / Whiskey Hill</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Hubbard / Woodburn / Whiskey Hill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Oregon, United States&lt;br&gt;Date: 2000-08-05 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: corroborated_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: direct_historical_imagery_match; uncertainty 0.025 km&lt;br&gt;Coordinates digitized from the user-supplied screenshot/status bar; uncertainty is conservative. The formation is directly visible in the 2000-07-28 historical imagery and is corroborated by the supplied aerial-photo registration. The evidence hash identifies the user-supplied historical-imagery screenshot, not the report URL.&lt;br&gt;Sources: ICCRA; Crop Circle Center PDF catalog; Paul Vigay Crop Circle Research&lt;br&gt;https://iccra.org/bystate/Oregon/ICCRA%20-%20OR%20-%20Whiskey%20Hill-Hubbard-Woodburn,%20Clackamas%20County%20(August%205,%202000).html; https://www.cropcirclecenter.com/; https://www.vigay.com/cropcircles/articles/us2000ae.html</description>
