      <Placemark>
        <name>2004-08-24 - Miamisburg</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Miamisburg&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ohio, United States&lt;br&gt;Date: 2004-08-24 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: registered_site&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: source_report_historical_imagery_coordinate_and_named_landmark_orientation; uncertainty 0.02 km&lt;br&gt;The ICCRA investigation records 39 degrees 37 minutes 12.36 seconds north and 84 degrees 16 minutes 14.08 seconds west, a 220-foot formation, and its alignment southeast of Miamisburg Mound. The source image and report-coordinate reconstruction support a 20 m registered-site center, but no withheld checkpoint set exists and the site is excluded from alignment tests.&lt;br&gt;Sources: ICCRA&lt;br&gt;https://iccra.org/bystate/Ohio/ICCRA%20-%20Ohio%20-%20Miamisburg,%20Montgomery%20County%20(August%2024,%202004).htm</description>
