      <Placemark>
        <name>2008-07-15 - Diessenhofen</name>
        <styleUrl>#site</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Diessenhofen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thurgau, Switzerland&lt;br&gt;Date: 2008-07-15 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: corroborated_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: four_control_landmark_scene_registration; uncertainty 0.06 km&lt;br&gt;The correct formation field is corroborated by four persistent boundary controls plus the Rhine, tree lines, buildings, farm tracks, and southern transport corridor. The source frame is oblique and the four-corner display warp has no independent withheld checkpoint, so it remains excluded from alignment calculations.&lt;br&gt;Sources: Wikimedia Commons&lt;br&gt;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Diessenhofen_crop_circles_(15.07.2008)</description>
