      <Placemark>
        <name>2015-07-21 - The Belt</name>
        <styleUrl>#candidate</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;The Belt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gloucestershire, England&lt;br&gt;Date: 2015-07-21 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: candidate_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: eight_control_projective_lane_woodland_field_registration; uncertainty 0.11 km&lt;br&gt;Explicit outcome: provisional_registration. The publisher BNG pointer and the 2015 wide aerial identify one long narrowing field between a curving lane and a persistent woodland belt. Eight boundary controls yield a coherent non-folded projective display fit with 20.84 m control-fit RMSE, but that is not independent accuracy evidence. The display anchor differs from the publisher pointer by 95.4 m, a second frame did not produce a stable independent transform, and zero checkpoints are held out. The 110 m candidate remains unaccepted and excluded from formal alignment calculations; source pixels are link-only.&lt;br&gt;Sources: Crop Circle Connector&lt;br&gt;https://cropcircleconnector.com/2015/TheBelt/TheBelt2015a.html</description>
