        <styleUrl>#candidate</styleUrl>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Etchilhampton (2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wiltshire, England&lt;br&gt;Date: 2015-08-19 (day)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Location role: candidate_field&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate method: publisher_bng_target_multi_formation_field_identification; uncertainty 0.025 km&lt;br&gt;Explicit outcome: candidate_field. The publisher's BNG target and wide aerial resolve the report to the large arable field west of Etchilhampton village. The wide frame visibly contains the report formation plus another formation in the same field, while the near-nadir images contain crop geometry and tramlines but no embedded camera pose, documented scale, or distributed persistent ground controls. To avoid conflating distinct formation events, no source-photo footprint is published; the 25 m candidate remains unaccepted and excluded from formal alignment calculations.&lt;br&gt;Sources: Crop Circle Connector&lt;br&gt;https://cropcircleconnector.com/2015/Etchilhampton2/Etchilhampton2015b.html</description>
